ns 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 36 of them. In 2025 the middle of the grids had January to February at 38% of normal and September to October at 66%. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 226% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 27169 had its driest year in 1958 at 61% of normal.</p>"}
